From f8386e32fccba988daa8d4eadc481e86e1344e2c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dan Fuller <dfuller@sentry.io>
Date: Mon, 28 Apr 2025 09:54:07 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] chore(migrations): Switch all uses of `RunSQL` over to
 `SafeRunSQL`, and stop relying on `allow_run_sql` (#90453)

Using `RunSQL` is dangerous, because it doesn't apply statement and
timeout locks when it runs. We have `SafeRunSQL` now, so we should rely
on that.

This removes uses of `RunSQL` in the migrations. I'll remove the code
that supports `allow_run_sql` in a follow up

